WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:17.000
Springtime Showers: minimise the beat player, then open Arrange into a song draft.

00:17.000 --> 00:28.000
The existing Verse and Hook have assigned takes. Choose Build in DAW.

00:28.000 --> 01:06.000
The DAW retains existing take lanes and shows the section lanes. This is a workflow example, not a finished mix.

01:06.000 --> 01:35.000
Choose Export audio, mix or stems, then Export stems (WAV · aligned at 0). Wait for confirmation.

01:35.000 --> 02:08.833
Stems exported: six files saved in Files → Cadence → Exports. Import all stems at time zero in another DAW.
